## Proposed Changes

### Database Layer (5 Migrations + 5 Models)

All tables use the `fg_` prefix, UUID primary keys generated on the frontend, `version` field for sync conflict detection, `sync_status` enum, and soft deletes.

#### [NEW] [create_fg_domains_table.php](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/database/migrations/xxxx_create_fg_domains_table.php)
- Columns: `id` (UUID), `user_id`, `name`, `emoji`, `color_hex`, `is_active`, `sort_order`, `version`, `sync_status`, soft deletes, timestamps
- Index: `user_id`

#### [NEW] [create_fg_tasks_table.php](file:///c:/my_project/myclass2026-main/database/migrations/xxxx_create_fg_tasks_table.php)
