| GET/POST | `/fg/subtasks` | FgSubTaskController | List by task / Create |
| PUT/DELETE | `/fg/subtasks/{id}` | FgSubTaskController | Update / Soft delete |
| GET/POST | `/fg/notes` | FgNoteController | List / Create |
| PUT/DELETE | `/fg/notes/{id}` | FgNoteController | Update / Soft delete |
| POST | `/fg/notes/sync` | FgNoteController | Batch sync |
| GET/POST | `/fg/sessions` | FgSessionController | List / Open |
| PUT | `/fg/sessions/{id}` | FgSessionController | Close / Check-in |
| POST | `/fg/ai/vent` | FgAiController | Text → AI → tasks+notes JSON |

